WEBVTT

00:00:35.260 --> 00:00:40.100
That woman is living in a fairy tale.  She believes she can save her homeland by sacrificing herself.

00:00:40.100 --> 00:00:44.060
And now you've come along too.
What's this, a foolhardy suicide squad?!

00:00:44.060 --> 00:00:47.480
Nami didn't come here to sacrifice herself.

00:00:47.480 --> 00:00:50.900
She was just the advance guard, coming to fight!

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:56.530
Get ready, Gold Lion Shiki!

00:00:56.840 --> 00:00:58.700
We're the main battalion!

00:01:01.010 --> 00:01:05.210
There's nothing left of your factory, your royal palace, or your island!

00:01:05.680 --> 00:01:08.380
Your plan has failed completely!

00:01:08.730 --> 00:01:10.940
I will never let you touch...

00:01:10.940 --> 00:01:12.380
my crew...

00:01:13.550 --> 00:01:14.880
or the sea...

00:01:16.050 --> 00:01:20.450
FOR AS LONG AS I LIVE!

00:01:21.750 --> 00:01:24.140
Gigant Thor...

00:01:27.850 --> 00:01:30.650
Axe!

00:01:32.960 --> 00:01:38.570
Is a man from East Blue really standing in my way again?!

00:01:38.570 --> 00:01:41.980
ROGER!

00:01:45.430 --> 00:01:47.020
The "Gold Lion", Shiki.

00:01:47.720 --> 00:01:53.630
This story begins three years before the curtain rose upon the Great Pirate Era.

00:02:04.220 --> 00:02:05.100
Fleet Admiral Kong!

00:02:05.450 --> 00:02:09.540
Roger and the Gold Lion have made contact in Edd War, over in the New World!

00:02:09.540 --> 00:02:10.830
Yeah, I heard.

00:02:10.830 --> 00:02:13.680
Wait, Garp!  We're not done talking.

00:02:14.060 --> 00:02:16.330
You might not be done, but I am.

00:02:16.330 --> 00:02:18.420
Garp!  Get back here!

00:02:20.300 --> 00:02:22.950
Garp-san, did you turn down your promotion again?

00:02:22.950 --> 00:02:25.910
That's so cool of you!

00:02:25.910 --> 00:02:29.540
I can already do as I like, so I don't need a higher rank!

00:02:29.540 --> 00:02:32.310
Tsuru-chan, let me come along if you're sailing out there.

00:02:32.310 --> 00:02:34.820
Nobody invited you to go, did they?

00:02:34.820 --> 00:02:37.740
You'll just break the ship as soon as you board, so I don't want you with me.

00:02:37.740 --> 00:02:39.250
Oh, don't say that.

00:02:39.250 --> 00:02:41.540
I'll be the one to take down that damn Roger.

00:02:48.110 --> 00:02:51.330
Garp!  I was entrusted with the Shiki case!

00:02:51.330 --> 00:02:52.520
Stay out of this!

00:02:52.870 --> 00:02:54.640
Oh, don't mind me.

00:02:54.640 --> 00:02:56.690
I'll let you take all the credit.

00:02:56.940 --> 00:02:58.860
That's not what I meant!

00:03:01.010 --> 00:03:05.110
Wow, Admiral Sengoku and Vice Admiral Garp are both going!

00:03:05.110 --> 00:03:06.780
Well, it is Roger after all.

00:03:06.780 --> 00:03:08.970
Garp-san just can't leave him alone.

00:03:10.290 --> 00:03:13.310
Captain Roger!

00:03:13.310 --> 00:03:15.810
Your life comes first, right?!

00:03:15.810 --> 00:03:19.310
Just this once, we should just listen to what the Gold Lion says!

00:03:19.730 --> 00:03:24.250
Hey, your body won't let you die no matter how many times they cut you, so why do you care?

00:03:24.250 --> 00:03:27.500
I still have weaknesses, you dumbass!

00:03:27.500 --> 00:03:31.040
Oh yeah, Crocus-san!  How is the captain's condition?

00:03:31.040 --> 00:03:32.970
He'd be better off not fighting, right?

00:03:32.970 --> 00:03:34.380
Please, medically relieve him!

00:03:34.380 --> 00:03:37.200
Unfortunately for you, he's in perfect shape!

00:03:38.580 --> 00:03:39.680
Rayleigh-san!

00:03:39.680 --> 00:03:40.950
Just give it up.

00:03:40.950 --> 00:03:44.500
We've been together a long time,
and we've never been able to stop Roger.

00:03:44.820 --> 00:03:46.440
No way!

00:03:46.440 --> 00:03:49.740
Have faith in Tom's ship, the Oro Jackson!

00:03:50.230 --> 00:03:52.580
Roger doesn't have much time left.

00:03:52.580 --> 00:03:55.980
How many times have we had this discussion, Roger?

00:03:56.470 --> 00:03:59.650
A lot of things have happened between us, but let's put the past behind us!

00:04:00.200 --> 00:04:04.610
We'll use that apocalyptic weapon you've found and my military might!

00:04:04.610 --> 00:04:09.780
And then, with the perfect plan I've spent so many years developing,

00:04:09.780 --> 00:04:12.830
we can conquer the entire world at once!

00:04:13.150 --> 00:04:16.030
Become my right hand man, Roger!

00:04:16.690 --> 00:04:20.540
I have no interest in conquering anything, Shiki!

00:04:20.540 --> 00:04:25.990
If you can't do as you please, there's
no point in being a pirate, is there?!

00:04:25.990 --> 00:04:28.950
No matter how you try to pressure me,

00:04:29.460 --> 00:04:34.690
Gold Lion!  I refuse your offer!

00:04:36.440 --> 00:04:38.140
Don't, Captain!

00:04:38.140 --> 00:04:40.810
Don't you realize how many ships we're up against?!

00:04:40.810 --> 00:04:41.580
Move.

00:04:41.580 --> 00:04:44.750
In other words, your answer is...

00:04:44.750 --> 00:04:48.970
"Please kill me right here and now!"  Isn't it?!

00:04:49.220 --> 00:04:53.310
No, it's "I'm gonna crush every last one of you!"

00:04:56.780 --> 00:05:01.250
The man known as the Chief of the Great Pirate Armada, Gold Lion Shiki...

00:05:01.930 --> 00:05:05.250
and the future Pirate King, Gold Roger, clashed.

00:05:08.240 --> 00:05:12.140
This fight came to be called the Great Battle of Edd War.

00:05:12.140 --> 00:05:14.690
Roger's ship, which many assumed would be completely obliterated,

00:05:15.640 --> 00:05:18.780
was spared by a sudden change of weather.

00:05:18.780 --> 00:05:22.630
In the end, half of Shiki's fleet sunk into the sea.

00:05:24.020 --> 00:05:27.660
Furthermore, an unfortunate accident befell Shiki...

00:05:27.660 --> 00:05:31.540
forcing him to flee the battlefield and tend to his injuries.

00:05:41.190 --> 00:05:43.190
So what about the steering wheel?

00:05:43.470 --> 00:05:46.220
Ah, Doctor Indigo.

00:05:47.810 --> 00:05:49.740
I can't remove it.

00:05:49.740 --> 00:05:54.420
It's stuck so deep in his skull that forcing it out could kill him.

00:05:54.420 --> 00:05:55.450
I see.

00:05:55.450 --> 00:05:56.630
It's fine.

00:05:57.790 --> 00:05:59.040
It happens all the time.

00:05:59.040 --> 00:06:04.910
No, accidentally getting a steering wheel stuck in your head in the middle of a battle is quite unheard of.

00:06:04.910 --> 00:06:07.750
Still, your vitality is as impressive as ever.

00:06:08.230 --> 00:06:12.550
Well, I am mighty enough to be called "Lion", after all.

00:06:12.550 --> 00:06:15.370
What the?!  Who's that chicken?!

00:06:15.370 --> 00:06:16.220
That's YOU!

00:06:16.220 --> 00:06:17.420
Yeah!

00:06:18.040 --> 00:06:20.130
Uh, no...

00:06:20.480 --> 00:06:25.710
Two years later, the Roger Pirates finally did the impossible...

00:06:25.710 --> 00:06:28.120
and successfully conquered the Grand Line.

00:06:28.120 --> 00:06:31.870
Gold Roger came to be known as the Pirate King.

00:06:33.160 --> 00:06:36.610
Shortly after, the Roger Pirates mysteriously vanished.

00:06:37.630 --> 00:06:40.780
Then, after another year had passed by...

00:06:41.230 --> 00:06:44.130
Extra!  Extra!

00:06:44.130 --> 00:06:48.420
News of the Pirate King's capture spread, surprising the entire world.

00:06:48.800 --> 00:06:51.260
Roger was captured?!

00:06:51.260 --> 00:06:52.690
Our sources are reliable.

00:06:52.690 --> 00:06:55.830
Liar!  You think I'd believe that?!

00:06:56.610 --> 00:07:00.770
You all know how strong he is, don't you?!

00:07:02.550 --> 00:07:05.150
Chief!  Please, calm down!

00:07:05.150 --> 00:07:07.540
Don't go spouting off random crap like that!

00:07:09.190 --> 00:07:10.610
Chief, where are you going?!

00:07:14.430 --> 00:07:15.850
Intruder alert!

00:07:17.630 --> 00:07:20.220
The intruders are by the plaza in Marineford Bay!

00:07:20.220 --> 00:07:21.220
How many are there?!

00:07:22.800 --> 00:07:24.320
No way! It's...!

00:07:24.640 --> 00:07:25.710
Just one!

00:07:25.710 --> 00:07:28.190
The enemy is the Gold Lion Shiki, and he's alone!

00:07:28.580 --> 00:07:33.700
There's no way Roger could've been caught by trash like you!

00:07:34.180 --> 00:07:37.290
I respected that man's strength!

00:07:37.290 --> 00:07:39.240
Admiral Sengoku!

00:07:40.060 --> 00:07:42.210
Roger is the Pirate King.

00:07:42.920 --> 00:07:45.880
In his battle with you, he left victorious.

00:07:45.880 --> 00:07:49.280
The Pirate King?!  So what?!

00:07:49.630 --> 00:07:53.990
If he'd have just lent me a hand, we could have ruled the world together!

00:07:54.840 --> 00:08:00.010
We might have been enemies, but we were part of the same era!

00:08:00.010 --> 00:08:01.760
If he's here, then let me see him!

00:08:01.760 --> 00:08:05.730
If he's gonna die, then I will be the one who kills him!

00:08:06.350 --> 00:08:10.350
The execution will take place in one week, in his hometown,

00:08:10.350 --> 00:08:15.470
the "Town of Beginnings" in East Blue, Loguetown.

00:08:16.420 --> 00:08:20.410
Roger's death should break the spirit of even the most formidable pirates.

00:08:20.410 --> 00:08:22.110
Vice Admiral Garp!

00:08:23.570 --> 00:08:26.670
The legend of the Pirate King, Gold Roger,

00:08:26.670 --> 00:08:30.390
will end in East Blue, the weakest sea?!

00:08:30.710 --> 00:08:32.810
Don't make me laugh!

00:08:32.810 --> 00:08:37.260
That'll be your last insult to that shithead, won't it?!

00:08:38.650 --> 00:08:40.930
Its weakness makes it the perfect place...

00:08:41.680 --> 00:08:43.900
East Blue is a symbol of peace!

00:08:44.590 --> 00:08:47.040
We will not let you interfere with the execution!

00:09:01.500 --> 00:09:04.960
Garp.  Sengoku.  The Gold Lion.

00:09:05.440 --> 00:09:11.650
Before reaching it's conclusion, their battle destroyed half of Marineford.

00:09:11.650 --> 00:09:13.050
What is this?!

00:09:13.050 --> 00:09:14.970
Hey!  Get the Vice Admiral away from here!

00:09:15.850 --> 00:09:18.290
Thus, the pirate, Gold Lion,

00:09:18.290 --> 00:09:21.470
was imprisoned at Impel Down.

00:09:24.690 --> 00:09:26.730
One week later...

00:09:26.730 --> 00:09:28.800
My wealth and treasure?

00:09:28.800 --> 00:09:31.420
If you want it, I'll let you have it!  Look for it!

00:09:32.030 --> 00:09:35.090
I left it all at that place!

00:09:43.910 --> 00:09:47.480
The death of the Pirate King, Gold Roger,

00:09:47.480 --> 00:09:50.600
raised the curtain on the Great Pirate Era!

00:10:01.330 --> 00:10:04.500
The news spread quickly around the world.

00:10:04.500 --> 00:10:09.490
The people understood that the seas would get a lot rougher from that point on.

00:10:10.090 --> 00:10:13.060
A frightening era is at hand.

00:10:13.410 --> 00:10:16.210
They say that more pirates will show up, Oimo.

00:10:16.210 --> 00:10:18.430
They won't attack us, though.

00:10:21.130 --> 00:10:24.220
Tonjit, did you hear?!  Huge news!

00:10:24.220 --> 00:10:26.840
Someday, I will set the world record for the largest stilts!

00:10:27.160 --> 00:10:28.690
Captain Cricket!

00:10:28.690 --> 00:10:31.170
They say that Roger died and left behind a huge treasure!

00:10:31.170 --> 00:10:32.690
This is amazing!

00:10:32.690 --> 00:10:35.150
So there's still some romance left in the world!

00:10:38.620 --> 00:10:42.550
Justice will grow stronger!  It must grow stronger!

00:10:44.240 --> 00:10:48.680
How can this be?!  A cursed child has been born!

00:10:48.680 --> 00:10:50.700
It's the curse of the Pirate Era!

00:10:50.700 --> 00:10:53.150
The Great Pirate Era?

00:10:53.150 --> 00:10:55.100
Can we all become pirates?

00:10:55.420 --> 00:10:59.440
It means that we've got to become stronger, or we can't join the pirate crew.

00:11:01.320 --> 00:11:03.430
Did you hear the news?

00:11:03.430 --> 00:11:06.650
They say the Pirate King died, leaving behind a huge treasure!

00:11:09.900 --> 00:11:12.550
The time of pirates has begun!

00:11:12.550 --> 00:11:14.650
Let us out!  Right now!

00:11:14.650 --> 00:11:16.670
A new era has begun!

00:11:16.670 --> 00:11:19.310
The seas of the new age belong to the pirates!

00:11:19.310 --> 00:11:22.090
Roger... How could you die?

00:11:22.980 --> 00:11:24.780
Ridiculous.

00:11:24.780 --> 00:11:29.030
Those treasure-hunting, empty-headed pirates will be a nuisance on the seas.

00:11:29.990 --> 00:11:32.200
What "new era"?

00:11:32.890 --> 00:11:35.070
Pirates are the rulers of the sea.

00:11:35.660 --> 00:11:37.540
Someday, I will make them understand that.

00:11:39.960 --> 00:11:42.750
And then, after another two years...

00:11:43.170 --> 00:11:46.130
The legend of the Great Prison crumbled.

00:11:46.130 --> 00:11:48.200
Warden!  Reporting in!

00:11:48.200 --> 00:11:50.470
Gold Lion Shiki has escaped!

00:11:50.470 --> 00:11:52.390
He's still somewhere inside the prison!

00:11:52.390 --> 00:11:56.080
What happened to his Sea Stone shackles?  Did they come loose?

00:11:56.080 --> 00:11:58.460
No, they're still locked.

00:11:59.410 --> 00:12:01.470
He severed off both of his feet!

00:12:03.030 --> 00:12:05.050
Find him, no matter what it takes!

00:12:05.050 --> 00:12:07.510
We cannot let someone like him escape!

00:12:17.300 --> 00:12:19.970
You don't know of my two swords?

00:12:19.970 --> 00:12:23.570
They're both named blades: Outou and Kogarashi.

00:12:23.570 --> 00:12:26.070
I-I-I want a promotion!

00:12:26.070 --> 00:12:28.290
Ah, I meant to say...!  Shiki!

00:12:29.580 --> 00:12:33.780
It's too bad for you, but I'm leaving now.

00:12:33.780 --> 00:12:37.250
I don't need my legs.  You can keep 'em.

00:12:37.250 --> 00:12:40.760
Thanks for taking such good care of me these past two years!

00:12:40.760 --> 00:12:44.510
Assistant Warden Magellan!  I found Shiki!  Please help me!

00:12:48.030 --> 00:12:52.130
And then, the pirate known as Gold Lion, whose fangs had been dulled once before,

00:12:52.130 --> 00:12:55.920
broke free from his cage, and was once again free to roam the seas.

00:12:56.400 --> 00:12:58.520
Shiki escaped!

00:13:04.210 --> 00:13:05.830
Alright, now I've got legs again.

00:13:11.590 --> 00:13:12.920
This is Sengoku.

00:13:12.920 --> 00:13:16.540
Sorry to interrupt you during your vacation Garp, but it's about the Gold Lion.

00:13:16.540 --> 00:13:20.510
Yeah, I heard.  We'd better be careful.

00:13:20.510 --> 00:13:23.420
He's not the kind of man who'd want to make peace.

00:13:23.420 --> 00:13:26.150
Still, I doubt he'll attack us right away.

00:13:26.770 --> 00:13:29.290
He's a pretty careful guy, after all.

00:13:31.170 --> 00:13:34.230
Makino!  Where'd Garp go?

00:13:34.230 --> 00:13:36.430
He said he was going to the mountain.

00:13:40.580 --> 00:13:43.170
You little brat, don't just wander off on your own!

00:13:43.590 --> 00:13:44.740
Wait, Ace!

00:13:44.740 --> 00:13:47.990
Ace-chan!  It's me, Grampa Garp!

00:13:47.990 --> 00:13:49.190
Garp?!
Ace-chan!  It's me, Grampa Garp!

00:13:49.190 --> 00:13:51.980
Uh, I mean, Garp-san... So you're back?

00:13:53.300 --> 00:13:54.360
Hey.

00:13:54.360 --> 00:13:57.180
I wanted our child to inherit the dojo...

00:13:57.430 --> 00:13:59.030
But if it's a girl...

00:13:59.030 --> 00:14:00.590
Oh, it'll be alright.

00:14:00.870 --> 00:14:03.490
You'll become strong, won't you Kuina?

00:14:03.740 --> 00:14:06.890
What's that?  A traveler's ship?  That's a rare sight.

00:14:08.280 --> 00:14:11.130
I heard rumors of a man named Yasopp.

00:14:12.810 --> 00:14:13.900
I'm Shanks.

00:14:14.920 --> 00:14:15.830
A pirate.

00:14:15.830 --> 00:14:18.870
Going Merry...

00:14:20.020 --> 00:14:22.740
Someday, I'd like to build a ship like this...

00:14:22.740 --> 00:14:25.030
They say that Shiki escaped from prison!

00:14:25.030 --> 00:14:28.710
If he comes to East Blue, I'll take him down!

00:14:29.260 --> 00:14:30.550
We'll be counting on you, Bellemere.

00:14:30.870 --> 00:14:32.470
The Gold Lion, huh?

00:14:32.470 --> 00:14:36.450
Captain Zeff!  I hear they call him the Flying Pirate.

00:14:36.450 --> 00:14:38.360
My kid's blowing bubbles!

00:14:39.360 --> 00:14:41.690
Damn it!  Another failure!

00:14:44.680 --> 00:14:48.570
That Hiluluk... He did it again?

00:14:49.020 --> 00:14:53.360
Your majesty!  Don't you think you're spoiling Wapol-sama a bit too much?

00:14:53.360 --> 00:14:56.440
Maybe you're right... I'm worried too.

00:14:56.790 --> 00:14:58.830
Nico Robin is in this country...

00:14:58.830 --> 00:15:02.780
She's just a kid, but apparently her bounty is 79 million Beli!

00:15:05.670 --> 00:15:08.150
What the...?!  I'm stuck!  I can't get out!

00:15:08.800 --> 00:15:12.220
How can this be?!  It's a miraculous fit!

00:15:12.810 --> 00:15:14.430
How's the sea train coming along?

00:15:16.110 --> 00:15:17.980
It's coming steady!

00:15:17.980 --> 00:15:20.380
I helped him, so it'll be alright!

00:15:20.380 --> 00:15:22.770
This guy can't make anything but weapons!

00:15:26.270 --> 00:15:28.620
It's useless, Laboon.

00:15:28.620 --> 00:15:31.660
I got on Roger's ship and made sure...

00:15:31.660 --> 00:15:34.180
The Rumbar Pirates are...

00:15:35.030 --> 00:15:39.450
We're going to deliver Binks' brew...

00:15:39.900 --> 00:15:41.540
42 degrees!

00:15:41.540 --> 00:15:44.760
It's so difficult!  42 degrees is really hard!

00:15:45.310 --> 00:15:47.790
Oh, I farted.

00:15:53.750 --> 00:15:55.200
I'm here, Shakki!

00:15:55.550 --> 00:15:58.750
Oh, Hacchan!  Welcome.

00:15:58.750 --> 00:16:00.090
Is Rayleigh here?

00:16:00.090 --> 00:16:02.860
He's inside.  Want some juice?

00:16:02.860 --> 00:16:03.740
Sure.

00:16:03.740 --> 00:16:05.440
Rayleigh!

00:16:06.930 --> 00:16:08.010
Rayleigh?

00:16:09.400 --> 00:16:11.170
So you made it out, eh, Shiki?

00:16:11.170 --> 00:16:14.350
Still, what do you plan to do now, after all this time?

00:16:20.280 --> 00:16:22.890
How's the sea without Roger?

00:16:24.950 --> 00:16:27.870
The wall that's blocked our way is now gone.

00:16:28.420 --> 00:16:31.400
Seems like this is your era, Whitebeard.

00:16:31.920 --> 00:16:36.640
If you've come here just to spout a load of crap, then I'm gonna send you to the bottom of the sea, Gold Lion.

00:16:38.660 --> 00:16:41.510
Good to see that you're still the same, old, annoying geezer.

00:16:42.460 --> 00:16:50.560
I'm planning to go into hiding for a while, and then I'll show this lukewarm era the true terror of pirates.

00:16:51.770 --> 00:16:54.660
You've got some new scheme going on?

00:16:57.080 --> 00:17:01.430
In the Grand Line, on the island that reaches into the clouds, Merveille...

00:17:02.020 --> 00:17:05.000
Doctor Indigo, is your research complete?

00:17:05.000 --> 00:17:07.890
I've made a discovery...

00:17:07.890 --> 00:17:12.580
It seems this island's balance is maintained by several types of flora.

00:17:12.860 --> 00:17:14.900
And these plants don't grow down on the surface...

00:17:14.900 --> 00:17:16.980
Just cut to the chase, Indigo.

00:17:16.980 --> 00:17:20.820
How many years will it take to fulfill my plan?

00:17:21.070 --> 00:17:22.740
Well, let's see...

00:17:22.740 --> 00:17:25.040
Ten... Fifteen...

00:17:25.040 --> 00:17:27.440
No, we can't do it any sooner than... Twenty years.

00:17:27.440 --> 00:17:30.150
Alright.  I see.

00:17:30.150 --> 00:17:32.360
The plan will commence in twenty years.

00:17:33.350 --> 00:17:36.530
I will show the world a living Hell!

00:17:38.190 --> 00:17:42.450
Then, twenty years pass...
